Package: rgoogleslides
Title: R Interface to the 'Google Slides' API
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hairizuan Bin", "Noorazman", role = "aut",
           email = "hairizuanbinnoorazman@gmail.com"),
    person("Vicent", "Boned", role = c("cre", "ctb", "cph"),
           email = "vicent.boned@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Provides an 'R' interface to the 'Google Slides' API
    <https://developers.google.com/slides/api>. Create presentations,
    add slides, insert text, tables, images, and videos programmatically
    from 'R'. Designed for reproducible reporting workflows where analysis
    results need to be pushed directly into 'Google Slides' presentations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/eivicent/rgoogleslides
